      "name": "mobile.screen.capture",
      "description": "Capture the current screen and return it inline with a captureId; a point read off that image can be clicked with screen.act CLICK {at}. With scan, regionScan lists compact visual components (neutral facts, each with an `at`). Example: {\"preset\":\"ai\"}",
