  "instructions": "MoBridge (Android only), CLI-first: one shared mobd daemon serves the CLI and MCP. Read mobridge://guide (or `mobridge guide --short`) before acting.\nSetup: call mobile.device.connect once (it installs/upgrades the companion APK and enables Accessibility); its result carries `usage`, the onboarding steps. On COMPANION_NOT_READY read details.diagnostics and recovery[0], then connect again; the error table is in mobridge://guide.\nMCP has exactly 5 tools: mobile.device.connect, mobile.screen.observe, mobile.screen.act, mobile.screen.capture, mobile.run. With a shell use the CLI for devices/connect/health --preflight/diag/trace/run and multi-step chains.\nFast path: when you know the query call mobile.screen.act directly (one action per call, pick the node by query); for two or more steps use mobile.run. Observe only when the screen is unknown, after navigation, when a match is ambiguous or when an action failed; do not observe at the end of a run unless returnState=true.\nCheck backend: \"device\" in every response; \"simulated\" is for test fixtures only. With several devices pass deviceId.\nA mutation must be verified (an empty or AUTO verify.policy lets MoBridge choose); DISPATCHED is not VERIFIED; on RESULT_UNKNOWN stop, never replay the mutation, and check `mobridge operation status <operationId>`. A stale NodeRef fails closed; only the original query may be resolved again.\nA single mutation carries an operationId; mobile.run carries a workflowId and stable stepIds; when switching MCP↔CLI look up the original operation/workflow status (`mobridge run --status --workflow-id <id>`).\nThe daemon picks the executor (Accessibility for UI, ADB for system, vision on NEEDS_VISION: use the current capture to choose coordinates). Do not call raw adb, uiautomator, coordinate taps or adb shell input.\nApp control is CLI only (`mobridge app ...`); device identity, permission policy and safety confirmation still apply. Full evidence: mobridge trace <traceId>. permission respond is not permission set.\n",
  "durationMs": 13001,
  "stderr": "[mobridge] ready on stdio\n"
}
